#從 Redfish 更改，再由 D-bus 驗證
1.透過 Redfish 新增使用者
  curl -k -u root:0penBmc -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{
  "UserName": "jimmy",
  "Password": "P@ssw0rd123",
  "Enabled": true,
  "RoleId": "Administrator"
}' \
https://127.0.0.1:8443/redfish/v1/AccountService/Accounts

2.查看是否新增
  curl -k -u root:0penBmchttps://127.0.0.1:8443/redfish/v1/AccountService/Accounts
⭐️ Result
{
  "@odata.id": "/redfish/v1/AccountService/Accounts",
  "@odata.type": "#ManagerAccountCollection.ManagerAccountCollection",
  "Description": "BMC User Accounts",
  "Members": [
    {
      "@odata.id": "/redfish/v1/AccountService/Accounts/jimmy"
    },
    {
      "@odata.id": "/redfish/v1/AccountService/Accounts/root"
    }
  ],
  "Members@odata.count": 2,
  "Name": "Accounts Collection"

3.驗證 D-bus
  busctl tree xyz.openbmc_project.User.Manager
⭐️ Result
`- /xyz
  `- /xyz/openbmc_project
    `- /xyz/openbmc_project/user
      |- /xyz/openbmc_project/user/jimmy   #新增一個名為jimmy的user
      `- /xyz/openbmc_project/user/root
